```
Engine oscillators/filters:
- master -> compressor -> destination.
- ambient pad: two oscillators (110, 164.81) triangle through lowpass 320 and gain .02, plus slow detune.
- engine: saw 42 * pitch, square 21, through lowpass 250, gain .05; noise buffer (2s) loop through bandpass 500 gain .015.
- Add LFO to gain for engine rumble.
- setSpeed: ratio kph/100; freq 42 + ratio*18? At idle 92 => 58Hz; boost 320 => 100Hz. filter 300+ratio*400. gain .04+ratio*.04? Keep subtle.
- boost(): whoosh noise 2.2s bandpass sweep 180->2400->400; saw osc 60->220->80; gain envelope .12; maybe includes "turbo".
- blip(freq) short sine.
- speech: `window.speechSynthesis`, cancel, utterance text, rate .92, pitch .55, volume 1. Choose voice with name includes "Google UK English Male" or "Daniel" or default. `onvoiceschanged` not needed. This can sound okay.
- On disable, ramp to 0 and suspend after 0.5? Keep context running if off. Fine.
- Need setEnabled called on click; ensure context resumed.

